 "text": "\nIntroduction\nThis document lists the tests, which must be performed on all\n Power transformers as the manufacturers recommendations for the frequency\n of tests.\nSafety Precautions\nA work permit must be issued.\nWear your safety helmet, shoes and safety belt when cleaning suspension\n insulators.\nTools and Equipment\nTan d equipment, 5000Volt Megger,\n Turns Ratio test equipment.\nTransformer Test Certificate Form\nSubstation:\nSerial No:\nManufacturer:\nMVA:\nVoltage:\nDate:\nHigh Voltage \nWinding Low Voltage\nWinding Ter. Winding\n1-Winding Insulation Resistance \n (Megger = 5000V)\nTransformer winding Temperature\n________ C\nNotes: \n..\n.....\n.............................\n.............................\n.........................................\n2a Winding Insulation Capacitance &\n Dissipation Factor (Tan d)\n For a Two Winding Transformer\n\nHV\nLV \nEarth\n(Simplified)\nTest # 1 = c1 + c2\nTest # 2 = c2\nTest # 3 = c1 + c3\nTest # 4 = c3\nTest # 5 = c1\nTest # 6 = c2 + c3\n(Accuracy Check)\nCheck that capacitance of Tests # :\n2 + 4 = 6 LV\n4 + 5 = 3 Earth\n2 + 5 = 1\nNotes: ......\n..\n.....\n.............................\n.............................\n.........................................\n2B Winding Insulation Capacitance &\n Dissipation Factor (Tan d )\n For a Three Winding Transformer\n\nHV \nLV \nTer.\n(Simplified)\nTest # 1 = c1 + c4+c2\nTest # 2 = c1\nTest # 3 = c2 + c4+ c6\nTest # 4 = c2\nTest # 5 = c3 +c5+c6\nTest # 6 = c3\nTest # 7 = c1 + c2 +c3\nTest # 8 = c4\nTest # 9 = c5\nTest # 10 = c6\n(Accuracy Check) LV Ter.\nCheck that capacitance of Tests #:\n2 + 8+ 9 = 1\n4 + 8+10 = 3\n6 + 9+10 = 1\nNotes: ......\n..\n.....\n.............................\n.............................\n.........................................\n3A\n Turns Ratio Test\n\nNotes: ......\n..\n.....\n.............................\n.............................\n.........................................\n3B Turns Ratio Test\n\nNotes: ......\n..\n.....\n.............................\n.............................\n.........................................\n4) D.C. Resistance of Windings\n\nNotes: ......\n..\n.....\n.............................\n.............................\n.........................................\nTransformer Tested By: ___________________________________\nApproved By :____________________________________________",
